window.products.push({"id":718073,"name":"Jiamos Friends TV Show Gifts Sequin Pillow Cover Mermaid Color Change Flip Cushion Cover Funny Gag White Elephant Gifts 16x16 inch No Filler,Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NRuq2H+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FRIENDS TV SHOW MERCH: A classic Friends pattern is printed on the front, and when your finger skips the sequins, a different pattern will appear. What an interesting design can be used as a funny gifts among friends. REVERSIBLE SEQUIN DESIGN- Sequins are arranged on the fabric in an orderly manner,and fingers are swiped for fun, free to write text or DIY emoticon. Due to overlap and mobility of sequins , white spots may appear on the face after flipping multiple times, which is inevitable. FUNNY GAG GIFTS- If you too know that one friend who is crazy for 90s sitcoms, then we have the perfect gift for them,This replica is a wonderful piece of decor that real fans will love to display in their homes. WHITE ELEPHANT GIFTS-Is available in a variety of vibrant colors, you can easily find the perfect color to match or complement your sofa or loveseat.also provide white elephant gifts for the upcoming Halloween, Thanksgiving and Christmas NO FADE,NO FILLER-This stylish pillow case covers with invisible zipper, and back side is cotton fabric.Easy care: hand wash, tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NRuq2H+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jiamos","source_asin":"B08P7P1PH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7P1PH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7P1PH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":718074,"name":"Vincent Van Gogh Daisies and Poppies Framed Matted Canvas Art, 11 by 14-Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7wbThmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang,matted framed art piece features daisies and poppies. Vincent van Gogh was a Dutch post-Impressionist painter whose work, notable for its rough beauty, emotional honesty and bold color, had a far-reaching influence on 20th-century art. He sold only one painting during his lifetime, and was little known to the art world at the time of his death, but his fame grew rapidly thereafter. His influence on Expressionism, Fauvism and early abstraction was enormous, and it can be seen in many of his works. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a 11x14 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a dark wooden frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional frames and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7wbThmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D6GRG02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D6GRG02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D6GRG02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
