window.products.push({"id":718085,"name":"Dimplex Addison DFP69139W Electric Fireplace Mantle with Firebox, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8yEzzqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add sophisticated style to any room with the classic white Addison fireplace You can create an elegant focal point, transforming any ordinary space into an outstanding room with the charm and grace of the Addison electric fireplace from Dimplex.  The Addison’s sophisticated styling features detailed crown molding, rounded pilasters, and a stepped hearth finished in classic white for an understated elegance, beautifully complementing any décor. Beautiful and practical Just one click of your remote control will turn on the Addison’s powerful fan-forced heater for instant warmth, and with the heater turned off, you’ll enjoy relaxing in front of the world’s most realistic flame effect even on warm nights.  Customize the appearance of the Addison fireplace to your personal preference with the adjustable flame speed and interior lighting controls. And, the Addison simply plugs in to any standard household outlet, so you can place the fireplace anywhere you like. Firebox features: • 26” firebox with wide-screen viewing area • 120 Volts / 1,440 Watts / 4,915 BTU. • Thermostat control. • Can operate with flame only, flame and low heat, or flame and high heat. • Includes On/Off remote control  • Flame speed control so users can set to their personal preference. • Hand crafted log sets look very realistic – no two are exactly alike. • Upper light can be adjusted to personal preference to accent the log set. • Dimplex patented flame technology, the most authentic electric flame on the market • Can be used for cost-effective zone heating – save energy costs by turning down your central thermostat and heating your favorite room with the Addison. • Improved fan design for more efficient heat circulation and quieter than ever! Why choose the Dimplex Addison fireplace? Realistic Flame > Dimplex invented the modern electric fireplace and continues to innovate exclusive technologies that dazzle the eye.  > Only Dimplex delivers the look of a real wood fire with its world-leading 3D flame  > The Addison fireplace comes with a 26” ready to install firebox which provides a soothing atmosphere with or without heat for year-round ambiance. Superior Quality > The Addison’s premium construction and durable finishes ensure long product life and protect your investment. > Hand crafted log set, unique to each unit, adds an extra touch of authenticity. > Crafted from superior grade wood with cabinet quality veneer. Easy Set-Up > The Addison assembles easily in minutes, without tools. > No venting or piping required, just plugs into any 120 Volt outlet.  > Easy to move from room-to-room or transport if you move! Packaged for Shipping > All Dimplex products are subjected to shipping simulation tests to determine the optimum combination of packaging and shipping method to ensure you receive your item in excellent condition. North American Design and Engineering Excellence > The Dimplex in-house staff of engineers make sure all products meet customer expectations by being well made, easy to assemble, simple to operate, and a pleasure to own.  > Quality is designed into Dimplex products at every stage of the development process and is ensured by detailed inspections throughout the production cycle. Operates for Pennies a Day > Costs only 2 cents per hour with flame only, 7 cents per hour with both flame and heat (based on average national residential electricity rates) Reliable Safety > Tempered front glass always stays cool to the touch - enjoy the fireplace ambiance without risk of children or pets getting hurt. > No dangerous combustion or harmful carbon monoxide. > UL approved for use in Canada and the U.S. > The Addison is 100% efficient and produces no carbon monoxide or other emissions. > Superior grade wood components are low-formaldehyde C.A.R.B. Phase 2 compliant. Dedicated Customer Support > The friendly and knowledgeable Dimplex support staff are trained in diagnostics and available to help should you ever require assistance. An economical and Time- saving Alternative to Wood, Gas and Gel Fireplaces > Unlike wood and gel fireplaces, there’s no mess with the Addison and no worries about running out of fuel or having to buy expensive wood or gel.  > Gas and wood fireplaces both require disruptive venting and expensive installation. With the Addison, you just plug it in. Warranty > The Addison boasts a comprehensive two-year warranty on parts and one-year warranty on labor including in-home service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8yEzzqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIMPLEX","source_asin":"B003XIHU72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003XIHU72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003XIHU72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
