window.products.push({"id":718093,"name":"Portable Blender Personal Blender USB Rechargeable Juicer Cup Fruit Mixing for Shakes and Smoothies with 12 oz Travel Cup and Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21evj2wuk7L._AC_.jpg","description":"➤Unique Bowling Design: 2021 New release personal juicer,creative bowling design great for fun ,Handy, Lightweight，when using,you can shake it for fun, shakes out the joy, shakes out the exquisite，which can also make the juice more delicate and tasty. DIY drinks, enjoy your colorful and healthy life with this blender. A delicious and interesting combination. ➤Multifunctional Juicer：Healthier and more versatile travel mixer，not only for making a protein shake,smoothie,juice,also works well for vegetable and baby food,all food grade materials，safe for people who have babies.It doesn't take up any space,you can easily throw it in your bag. Curved your hunger and gives you energy throughout the day .Great for traveling and outsides sports. ➤Safety & Rechargeable: Make sure the two small arrows on the cup and the base are aligned and accompanied by a beep before the juicer run. Multi-safety protection with patented hidden blade user friendly design, rechargeable battery can be easily charged by power bank, laptop, or other USB devices, progressive indicator can real-time display the remaining battery power. ➤Easy to Use & Clean: Simply one button design make it easier to use, press the button，let it go you don't have to hold it , runs for 21 seconds and then your perfect single serve smoothies is ready for you. When finished making your smoothies，attach juicer cup again,put a few pumps up soap in it,a little bit of water and just press the button then let it clean itself,it's literally the easiest self-cleaning bottle. ➤Professional made: High quality products, long service life, UL, CE certified, safe and has no impact on your health. if quality problems are founded, please feel free to contact us，we are always at your service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21evj2wuk7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HHSUC","source_asin":"B07RCBJ4QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RCBJ4QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RCBJ4QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
