window.products.push({"id":718095,"name":"Makerskit Classic Cocktail Bar Set, Includes Hardwood Muddler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615evCiBYQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description This unique bar set makes creating your own classic cocktails a breeze. Equip the home bar with everything needed to get the party started. Our bar set is made to commercial standards for bars and restaurants. From the Manufacturer What's in the box? Includes- Quart Size Mason Jar Shaker, Stainless steel strainer and ice tongs, Hardwood muddler, Cocktail stir spoon, Double Jigger 1 & 1.5oz, and 2 pour spouts Make something unique! This set makes a great gift to complete a bachelor pad, celebrate a wedding or birthday, or how about throwing your own speakeasy, classic cocktail mixology party? Use our PDF mixing guide featuring 24 easy to make favorites to help you get started. Also, check out our video guides were you will learn how to a pop-rock martini, root beer float, and other specialty drinks A great twist on the classic bar set Share your unique creations with us at #makerskit Perfect for the experienced Bartender or for someone starting in Mixology Step-by-Step Directions Learn a new skill in 5 minutes! Watch our fun How-To video guide where we walk you through your entire project. Expert makers will give you instructions and tips on how to get the most out of your DIY experience. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Artisinal, Mixology, Speak Easy Where did you get the inspiration for your product? I worked as a barternder and when I was not at the job It was always difficult to find all the quality tools you needed to create the very best cocktails. This kit came out of the need to have an easy way to purchase all the hard to find bartending tools. What differentiates your product from similar products out there? We give an old classic, a unique twist. Our quart size mason jar is a welcome change from the stainless steel shakers that dominate the market. We also make sure that you have absolutely everything you need! No more looking for a long enough spoon to stir your martini, or trying to pour into the right amount into a jigger without abottle spout. Did we mention the high quality hardwood muddler? Can someone say Mojitos? Tell us about the best and most challenging parts of the creation process. Staying sober long enough to finish designing this kit was the by far the biggest challenge. We’re just kidding of course! The real challenge was making sure that everything was covered in this bar set. We wanted to make sure we designed a cocktail kit that would allow people to create just about every cocktail they could imagine, and even give them the tools to possibly create some concoctions of their own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615evCiBYQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MakersKit","source_asin":"B00OMEWRRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OMEWRRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OMEWRRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
