window.products.push({"id":718106,"name":"Home-X Stainless Steel 3 in 1 Butter Knife, Curler, Slicer, Shave and Butter Grater, Bread and Bagel Slicer, Jelly Spreader, Kitchen Gadgets-8” L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516oFBAosRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want a new butter knife but don’t want to waste money on buying an entire set? Our durable butter knife makes a great replacement when one of your older butter knives bends, breaks, or rusts beyond repair. This knife is made from durable, heavy-duty metal, so you don’t have to worry about it bending or breaking from constant use. Use it on toast, bagels, muffins, rolls, and more! The serrated edges make it easy to cut into all bread types. It’s strong enough to even cut into butter that’s been frozen in the freezer. Watch as your butter squeezes through the slotted holes of the knife, allowing for easier spreading. The rounded point of the knife helps prevent accidentally making a hole in your bread while you spread your topping. This knife is so versatile that it can even complement your other silverware or cutlery in your utensil storage case, shelf, drawer, or cabinet. Match it with a metallic butter tray and place it on your kitchen table or countertop to add a bit of modern decor to your kitchen setup. Take it with you while camping, picnicking, and even road tripping so you’ll have a reliable spreader when the time comes. Don’t just get one for yourself — purchase multiple rounded butter knives now and give them out as gifts to your friends and relatives. This butter knife makes a simple housewarming gift for a new neighbor. Forget about all those other cheap, flimsy knives on the market. Buy our high-quality butter knife today, and have comfort in knowing that you’ll get a perfect spread on your bread each and every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516oFBAosRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07ZBGS4TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZBGS4TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZBGS4TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
