window.products.push({"id":718157,"name":"Daverose Calming Weighted Blanket for Adults 20lbs 58\"X80\" 180-220lbs Adults Queen Size | Plush Minky One Piece Design | Children Comfort Sensory Heav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+mqxl3peL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤Hi! My name is Daverose Weighted Blanket!❤ ♡Great to know you as my best friend here, our story begins when you click on this link! :) ♡Daverose is a professional design and production weighted blanket company, which focuses on home textile for more than 15 years. ♡Daverose is the forerunner in the development of weighted blankets. We have the cotton inner layer for the 1.0 version. ♡And now, after a year of market research, we are proud to introduce our 2.0 version -- minky fabric two color one piece integration weighted blanket. ♡It is unique, you can hardly find an exactly same one in the market, as this is the result of our long-term efforts. ♡We want to add more elegance and fashion to a traditional weighted blanket, so our blankets not only bring you ultra-soft and skin-friendly touch, but also improve your experience through its beautiful look. ♡We care what you care, all the weighted blankets are made of 100% non-toxic, hypoallergenic, odorless and eco-friendly glass beads. Our 7-layer sewing system makes it durable and long lasting by preventing glass beads leaking out. ♡Now you have better choices for gifts to your family/friends as this is not only a blanket, but also a healthy and charming hug. Package Contents 1 x Weighted Blanket 1 x Exquisite Bag (Easy to carry with you when travel) 1 x Instruction Manual Warm Notice 1.Weighted blankets are made to fit the BODY and not the BED. 2.Please contact us first before return if you have any concerns. 3.Due to manual measurement, please allow 1-2cm difference. 4.Welcome to develop more colors you like by sending us emails and we will send you the first sample when we adopt your idea. :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+mqxl3peL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daverose","source_asin":"B07XRCPQ5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XRCPQ5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XRCPQ5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
