window.products.push({"id":718284,"name":"Smartwhiz Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless, Battery Operated Stainless Steel Sanitizer & Soap Dispenser with Sensor Fingerprint Resistant & Waterpr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYAjrYwaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SMARTWHIZ SOAP DISPENSER FOR KITCHEN & BATHROOM - Automatic touch free soap dispenser comes with 4 levels of soap liquid volume. - Automatic soap dispenser uses innovative Infra-Red Technology to automatically detect your hand under the dispenser. ADVANTAGES: - It releases just the right amount of soap, make it easier for you and your kids to clean their hands. - You'll never have to touch a regular soap dispenser full of germs again which will help to keep your home and surroundings germ and bacteria free. - The stylish design dispenser will modernize with any decor, perfect for your kitchen and bathroom. - With a 9.56OZ capacity re-fill tank, there will be no need to refill regularly. Tips for extending the lifespan of Soap Dispenser - Please place unit on flat surface without water covering and do not flush the unit with strong flowing water. - Please turn off the unit first to prevent dispensing accidentally when you need to move it. - Please keep the motion sensor cleaning. STEPS: Step 1 Please pry the gap between the base cover stand and the body with your fingernail, and gently pull out the base. Step 2 There are not screwed on. Depress the latch on the battery compartment and it will pull off. Please put 4 X 1.5V new AAA batteries(not included) into the battery compartment. Step 3 Put two plastic convexities into the slots, then fit properly the battery compartment till hearing a click sound. Step 4 Please align the convex point of bottom cap to the sensor in parallel, and press it back tightly till bottom cap fits perfectly into the base. Specifications: Material: Stainless steelCapacity: 280ml/9.56oz Power Supply: 4 AAA Battery(not included)Product Dimensions: 7.9 x 4.1x 3.5 inchesPackage Contents: 1 Soap Dispenser, 1 User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYAjrYwaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartwhiz","source_asin":"B076P61R1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076P61R1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076P61R1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
