window.products.push({"id":718295,"name":"Sofa Cover Polyester Stretch Slipcover Chair Loveseat Sofa Cover Available for 1 2 3 4 Four People, Furniture Covers for Pets Sofa and loveseat (Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZAvcfDShL._AC_SL1088_.jpg","description":"Description: without Pillowcase Easy To Clean, Washable and Durable, Do not need ironing With stretch material, It suits for most types sofa, like fabric sofa, or leather sofa with gap. Overall cover will completely protect your sofa from stains, baby’s poo poo, Pet Hair or any other damage. Size: -if your sofa's length with 90cm-140cm / 35\" - 55\" please choose size \"Chair\" -if your sofa's length with 145cm-185cm / 57\" - 72\" please choose size \"Loveseat\" -if your sofa's length with 190cm-230cm / 74\" - 90\" please choose size \"Sofa\" -if your sofa's length with 230cm-300cm / 90.55\" - 118.11\" please choose size \"XL Sofa\" Note: 1. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. 2. Please allow 1-3mm error due to manual measurement. Pls make sure you do not mind before you bid. 3. Our product need foam peices to help tuck the cover into the couch, to make sure our cover will fit your sofa better, please check there are spaces(gaps) on the back and two arms to let the foam strip in, so it can hold the corners and shape the cover, also our cover will fit regular sofa better. Package included: 1 x Sofa cover How to install: Steps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back Steps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight Steps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly Steps 4: Put the sofa down and pll cover tight, pulling any excess fabric to the back Steps 5: Enjoy your newly coverd sofa!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZAvcfDShL._AC_SL1088_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waligastore","source_asin":"B07D7NW3JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7NW3JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7NW3JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
