window.products.push({"id":718332,"name":"The Den - Tobacco and Whiskey - Long Lasting Highly Scented Wax Melts, Many Scents to Choose from","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dfxv+mogL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All of our highly scented wax melts are hand poured by our amazing team to ensure perfection is met with each package. When using your new wax melts, place 1-2 wax cubes into a wax melt warmer and warm for no more than 4 hours at a time. Once wax melts no long throw a scent, remove wax from wax warmer and replace with new wax cubes Wax warmers and wax will become HOT. Use on a heat resistant surface and keep out of reach of children. Our wax melts are great for birthday gifts, holiday gifts, business gifts, casual use, for the home, for the kitchen, for the bedroom, for the bathroom, or for any situation where a nice scent will come in handy (there are lots)!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dfxv+mogL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plaid Stallion","source_asin":"B07RW5GYQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RW5GYQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RW5GYQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":718333,"name":"SaWang's 20oz Tumbler with Lid, 2 Straw, Brush, Double-layer Vacuum Insulated Mug with Frosted Surface, Stainless Steel Travel Coffee Cup Suitable for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cci6sBubS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Environmental protection attributes The number of disposable cups consumed globally every year is as high as 500 billion. In order to reduce this number, we will continue to focus on providing environmentally safe and conscious portable water cups. Please form the habit of using the accompanying cup. Bonus Straw Cleaner How do you find something small enough to clean a reusable straw? If you’re like most people who enjoy things mold and bacteria free, you’ll appreciate our FREE gift of a mini Wire Straw Cleaner. Vacuum structure: The stainless steel cup adopts the structure of a vacuum liner to seal between the two cup walls and pumps it into an approximate vacuum, which reduces the heat conduction and plays a role of heat preservation. With lid and straw: The travel mug is equipped with a BPA-free sliding cover to prevent water sprinkling. Our tumbler cup shape fits a standard size cup holder. Sweat free design: The surface of the portable vacuum cup is frosted to prevent perspiration and condensation, ensuring that it will not leave spots or burn yourself! Insulation and cold preservation: The double-layer vacuum insulated cup can prevent heat from being transferred to the outer wall of the stainless steel cup. This means that the tumbler can keep your favorite drink cold or piping hot for hours. So you can enjoy a cool drink by the pool, drinking water anytime, anywhere. Suitable for all kinds of drinks: Use a vacuum mugs to hold milk, juice, soda, water, coffee or sports supplements. Do whatever you want to replenish the water your body needs to meet your needs every moment Travelling: 20 ounces, this portable water cup can meet your daily hot or cold drink needs. Very suitable for parties, picnics, self-driving trips, boats, beaches, swimming, camping and hiking, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cci6sBubS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SaWang's","source_asin":"B099WTRMG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099WTRMG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099WTRMG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
