window.products.push({"id":718427,"name":"German Christmas Decoration Pyramid and 20pcs Red Candles Included-Wood Nativity Scene -Christmas and Tabletop Holiday Decor-3 Tiers Carousel-6 Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c-6o2-z6L._AC_SL1384_.jpg","description":"German Christmas Pyramid It is suggested that the Christmas pyramid is a predecessor of the Christmas tree. These pyramids are not limited to Christmas: in the Erzgebirge there was a custom of dancing around the \"St. John's Tree\", \"a pyramid decked with garlands and flowers\", at the summer solstice. Not actually pyramid-shaped, the Christmas pyramid is a kind of carousel with several levels, some depicting Christian motifs such as angels or manger scenes, and others with more secular motifs such as mountain-folk, forests, and other scenes from the everyday life of people in the Erzgebirge. The spinning motion of the pyramids is traditionally achieved with the help of candles whose rising heat spins a propeller above. Dimensions: 18” x 7.5 x 6.5” (base) x 11” (top fan) In the Box: 1 x Christmas Pyramid 6 x Candle Holders 12 x Fan Blades 1 x Fan Blades holder 1 x Ceramic Nub 1 x Wood Nub Holder 1 x Manual & Instructions Red Candles Included Dimensions: 4-inch x 0.5 Inch Diameter Burn Time up to 1.5 Hours. Maintain color throughout burning. 100% Cotton wick Unscented and Clean Burn","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c-6o2-z6L._AC_SL1384_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA SUPREME","source_asin":"B08NXRHX44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NXRHX44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NXRHX44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
