window.products.push({"id":718443,"name":"Drink Dispenser for Fridge, Number-one Soda Organizer for Refrigerator with Automatic Pusher Glide, Width Ajustable Soda Can Organizer for Beer, Pop C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dRzwyyzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Arc Design】Soda can organizer for refrigerator adopts arc structure design, convenient storage of canned drinks is not easy to squeeze deformation. The thruster uses a power spring design that automatically and smoothly slides the drink forward, always pushing it forward for easy storage and removal. It also keeps the pantry neat and organized. 【Premium Material】Soda can organizer can use food grade materials, arc baffle and thruster are Alec, no burr, will not hurt the hand, the grid is made of stainless steel, sliding rail is ABS material and stainless steel, strong wear resistance, good bearing capacity. The fixed strip can be cut arbitrarily according to the width of the drink, which can meet different customer needs. 【Large Capacity】The width between the two fixed strips of the drink organizer for fridge can be adjusted or cut. Each slot of the refrigerator organizer can hold about 4-5 cans or bottles, 5 slots can hold 20-25 cans or bottles in 5 wide can hold 25-30 cans/bottles. The can organizer for refrigerator fits most standard size jars and bottles (12 oz, 16 oz, 17 oz, etc.). 【Easy to Install and Easy to Clean】Drink organizer for fridge is very easy to install, no need to use any tools, first you need to prepare the fixing strip, then snap on the blocking strip, then snap on the propeller, and it is installed. Refrigerator beverage organizer uses acrylic material use a rag to gently wipe it clean. 【Wide application】The visi fast drink organizer can be used for many kinds of beverages, such as canned and bottled beverages (juice, soda, beer, etc.). Soda dispenser for fridge can be widely used in home refrigerators, lifestyle supermarkets, vending machines, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dRzwyyzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Number-one","source_asin":"B0BLCJCZG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCJCZG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCJCZG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
