window.products.push({"id":718445,"name":"By Luck Temperature Display Water Bottle 16oz - Vacuum Insulated Thermos Bottles, Leakproof, BPA Free, Double Walled Reusable Travel Mug for Keep Hot/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519R5q6Dy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Temperature Display & Lid Rechargeable】- Thermos water bottle lid has a built-in precision temperature measuring device. You only need to touch the display of the lid to let you always know the temperature inside the mug. Three color cues: Red for scalding water (65℃ or more). Green for warm water (35~65℃). Blue represents cool water (0~35℃). Mug lid built-in 300 mAh battery, the top adopts magnetic suction charging, gently put can be charged, but can not be heated for the beverage inside the insulation mug. 【Double Vacuum Insulation & Leak-Proof】- 316 stainless steel double layer vacuum travel water bottle can keep the heat of your drink for a long time. Hot beverages such as hot tea or hot coffee can stay hot for 9 hours, while cold beverages such as iced coffee can stay cold for 12 hours. The lid has a built-in sealing silicone ring so that drinks inside the thermos bottle won't leak, making it leak proof and spill proof, easy for you to carry around. Not recommended for carbonated beverages. 【High Quality】- 100% food grade stainless steel, BPA free and odorless, so you can be safe from toxins. Using reusable, sturdy and durable travel coffee cups instead of using disposable plastic cups will better protect the environment. The lid is sealed and waterproof. Travel Bottle also comes with a sponge cleaning brush, easy to clean the inside of the mug. Hand wash recommended, not recommended to put the insulation mug and lid in the dishwasher to clean. 【Suitable for Car Cup Holder】- The portable 16 oz insulated coffee travel Bottle fits most car cup holders. Perfect for accompanying you on your daily life, ideal for indoor and outdoor activities such as home, office, parties, travel, camping and picnics, etc. Also stylish and elegant with excellent insulation properties the insulated stainless steel water bottle is perfect as a gift for your family, loved ones and friends. 【After Sales Service】- If you have any questions about our thermos Bottle, please feel free to contact us. We will be happy to solve your problem. 3 months manufacturer warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519R5q6Dy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"By Luck","source_asin":"B0BL3NQMMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3NQMMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3NQMMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
