window.products.push({"id":718623,"name":"Made in Japan Lucky Cat Tokoname Porcelain 9.1'' White Left Hand Maneki Neko (Left Hand)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":100.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iv+JBYb8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Pottery Maneki Neko, made in Tokoname Aichi Prefecture. The Maneki Neko - also known as a lucky cat - is a popular Japanese lucky charm in the shape of a seated cat. The Maneki Neko is also very popular in Japan, and is situated either in the entrance or restaurants. There, she brings the owner happiness, contentment and a healthy life, or money and riches. The cherryblossoms on the front promise happiness and health for all four seasons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iv+JBYb8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tokoname Maneki Neko","source_asin":"B06Y2LXHXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2LXHXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2LXHXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":718624,"name":"RecPro RV Hide a Bed Memory Foam Mattress Upgrade Gel Infused Cooling top with Bamboo Ticking. (60\" Hide-a-Bed 48\" x 71\" Mattress)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2nCfB3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These hide-a-bed replacement mattresses are the perfect solution for you and your comfort needs. An upgrade in every sense, these specially constructed mattresses feature bamboo ticking (a natural cool gel topping and moisture-wicking material), memory foam support for your overall comfort, and they are gel-infused for an even greater increased level of comfort. These mattresses are made for superior comfort and engineered for durability. You can’t go wrong by purchasing this compact comfort piece. Details: Size: 5\" thick to fit within hide-a-bed. Bamboo ticking. Very soft, nice touch Instantly absorbs moisture. Bright look. Washable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2nCfB3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RecPro","source_asin":"B07HKKFBBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HKKFBBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HKKFBBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":718625,"name":"Ancient Cookware, Clay Chamba Comal, Cayana, 12 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-4p7xc5OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comals are very popular all throughout Latin America to cook tortillas, toasting spices, or sear meat. They are great for toasting and softening dried chilies. In Colombia, they are widely used to toasting arepas. Length 12.0 in, Width 12.0 in, Height 1.5 in, Diameter 12.0 in. Can also be used to serve food with a stunning presentation. Completely natural and safe, contains no toxins or lead and the porous nature of the clay allows the slow evaporation of steam, keeping the food healthy, tasty and moist. Will last many years with proper use and care (each piece comes with a product information sheet outlining the Uses and Care for the product). Black Clay, Chamba Cookware, is well-known and used throughout Colombia in restaurants and homes for preparing and serving traditional dishes. Its origins can be traced back at least 700 years to vases and pitchers found in pre-Columbian archaeological sites. It is still made in the traditional manner, by families in a small village on the banks of the Magdalena River in Central Colombia. Each piece is hand-made using local area clays, then hand burnished with a stone. The pieces are then fired in the village, giving them the distinctive black color and elegant look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-4p7xc5OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B00QHD5KKE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QHD5KKE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QHD5KKE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
