window.products.push({"id":718647,"name":"Sir Winston Churchill Busts Sculptures Handmade in The UK from Plaster. Winston Churchill Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ouXLJLzNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sir Winston Churchill was the Prime Minister of the United Kingdom from 1940 to 1945 and again from 1951 to 1955. Churchill was also an officer in the British Army, a non-academic historian, a writer (as Winston S. Churchill), and an artist. He won the Nobel Prize in Literature in 1953 for his overall, lifetime body of work. In 1963, he was the first of only eight people to be made an honorary citizen of the United States. In his Speech to the House of Commons may 13th 1940 he uttered the immortal words - \"...we shall defend our Island, whatever the cost may be...we shall never surrender.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ouXLJLzNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Sculptures","source_asin":"B07148SYYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07148SYYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07148SYYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":718648,"name":"Lily's Home Unbreakable Cabernet and Merlot Bordeaux Red Wine Glasses, Made of Shatterproof Tritan Plastic, for Indoor and Outdoor Use, Reusable and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZLSnC7mJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"BRILLIANT FOR PARTIES: The Unbreakable Cabernet and Merlot Red Wine Glasses from Lily's Home comes in a set of two glasses, and each holds up to 20 ounces of your favorite red wine. No longer serve your guests with unattractive plastic. These shatterproof glasses are both elegant and long-lasting - Your perfect outdoor wine glasses UNBREAKABLE ACRYLIC WINE GLASSES: Each glass is made with the incredibly sturdy and BPA-free Tritan material. Tritan is crystal clear and looks just like glass, yet won’t shatter even if dropped outdoors. They have the classic look of red wine glasses and measure approximately 9\" tall to hold nearly an entire bottle of wine. KEEP THE BRILLIANT SHINE: The Unbreakable Tritan drinkware from Lily's Home is dishwasher-safe. These fantastic plastic wine glasses must be put on the top rack only and are not suitable for a heated cycle. They can be hand washed gently without harsh abrasive detergents or scouring pads to keep them looking their best. A GREAT GIFT IDEA: Lily's Home makes a wide array of products for every home and garden lover. Whether you're looking for a perfect gift to spruce up your friend's garden, or if you need a housewarming present, Lily's Home has something for everyone! MAKE A HOUSE A HOME: Lily’s Home offers beautifully designed clocks, dishware, garden decorations, and more to add a touch of style to any home. Whether you’re looking for a statement piece for your living room or looking for a way to add more color to your garden, Lily’s Home has just what you’re looking for!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZLSnC7mJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lily's Home","source_asin":"B0C5JMML96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5JMML96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5JMML96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
