window.products.push({"id":718743,"name":"Rellorus Radiator Heater, Space Oil Filled Heater 1500W, 4 Modes, 24H Timer, Adjustable Thermostat, Quiet, Electric Portable Heater with Remote for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61swm2mGYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥Personalized Comfort Heating Modes: Rellorus radiator heater equipped with 600W/900W/1500W heating modes for quick heating, it also comes with an ECO mode that you can activate if you’re looking to get a more cost-effective way of using electricity. 🔥Precise Electric Thermostat: Set your temperature from 41℉ to 95℉ in 1℉ increments. It gives you more control to heat different size spaces up to 300 square feet and can be used in variable temperatures conditions. 🔥Digital Display and Touch Control: An upgraded cool-looking LED panel and better interface, just one touch to adjust your space heater. Remote control also provides 19-feet access to all the heater settings. 🔥Warmup Before Arriving Home: 24H timer allows you to set heater turn on/off at your convenience, you can also set the auto on time while on standby. The radiator will continue to release heat even after it is switched off. 🔥Humanization Design Make Life Easier: The heater is made in a convenient housing on wheels, a handle for movement and a plug hole for the cord storage. No tools required for assembly. 🔥Enhanced Safety System: Loaded with a bunch of safety features, child lock, tip-over switch, overheating protection and ETL certification mechanisms. V0 flame retardant 2-prong plug and sturdy 6ft long flat power cord. Safe and worry-free for all-day use. 🔥Baby and Family's First Choice: Oil filled room heaters work by both convection and radiation to release a fairly gentle and silence form of heating, which neither burn oxygen nor reduce humidity, it won't cause any suffocation or dry eyes, skin rashes, making the healthier option for new born babies and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61swm2mGYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rellorus","source_asin":"B0B2DNHYMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DNHYMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DNHYMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
