window.products.push({"id":718928,"name":"Lush Decor French Country Geo Ruffle Bedding, 3-Piece Bedspread Set (Queen, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GVMKum4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our French Country Geo Ruffle bedding set. This modern bedding includes 1 quilt and 2 matching pillow shams. Refresh your master or guest bedroom with this bedspread set featuring embossed geometric quilting details and a fitted ruffle skirt that kisses the floor. This modern comforter set is made with soft crinkle microfiber and includes 2 matching pillow shams with a ruffle trim for a touch of elegance.The queen quilt measures 80\" L x 60\" W, and each pillow sham measures 20\" L x 26\" W with a decorative trim. This modern quilt set is made for a queen-size bed, but we also offer this design in other traditional sizes. All of our pieces are made of 100% polyester, which is extremely durable and breathable. This material helps wick away moisture as you sleep. We recommend washing your bedding set in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle with similar colors. Tumble dry on low to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious bedding pieces. Iron on low heat as needed, and use only non-chlorine bleach.Our cozy, lightweight quilt sets come in various colors, making it easy to coordinate with other colors and decor in your home without being overwhelming. The subtle geometric and quilted design can accent any interior decor style, from bohemian to farmhouse. At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of chic home accessories, ranging from curtains to luxury bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GVMKum4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B0893GZSS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-718928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0893GZSS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0893GZSS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
